 "guide": [
  {
   "path": "/shared_nfs/qiangh/mywork/arbor_dsv41flash/experiments/musespark-c16-ab/GUIDE.md",
   "sha256": "793eee2b2427603f30188d1bdefad0b8d65f4d68fca7c965c05912c2068faa95",
   "size": 4802,
   "mtime": 1794956254,
   "head": [
    "# musespark-c16-ab: independent before/after re-measure of campaign 3 (intent and constraints)",
    "",
    "Written 2026-11-17 before launch (CLAUDE.md: write intent before launch). Task source: the master agent's request of",
    "2026-11-17 (user requirement): campaign 3 (`musespark-c16-tput`, Hyperloom MB) has only Arbor's in-run tracking",
    "(b01: 45784.03 -> 63016.66 SGLang total_token_throughput, 50 iterations, 7 KEEP / 9 REVERT / 34 PROBE) and MB's FINAL",
    "reproduction; it never had a full independent before/after. This run supplies it.",
    "",
    "## Goal",
    "",
    "Same node, same image, same bench client, same corpus, same C16 load; only the served tree + launch differ:",
    "",
    "- **before** = the CI recipe point, pristine: InferenceX `8a76a78e41`, `musespark/sglang/mi355x-fp4-mtp/agentic.yaml`,",
    "  `override_tp4_c16`, on the image's SGLang tree as shipped. (`configs/before.json`)",
    "- **after** = campaign 3 branch b01's final kept state: the same tree + `after/landed.patch` (the 5 source KEEPs, iters",
    "  4, 6, 17, 24, 35) and b01's kept launch `after/workspace_config.json` (the 2 config KEEPs, iters 3 and 9:",
    "  `--swa-full-tokens-ratio 0.2`, `--speculative-use-block-verification`). (`configs/after.json`)",
    "- Each: fresh server, AgentX replay 3600 s at C16 + GSM8K 1319 (`sglang.test.few_shot_gsm8k`), outputs",
    "  `runs/<tag>/bench_output.json` and `runs/<tag>/gsm8k.log`. Metric of record: total tok/s/GPU (also x4 = total).",
    "",
    "## Pins",
    "",
    "| What | Pin | Evidence |",
    "|---|---|---|",
    "| CI run | InferenceX 38877885539 (2026-10-16), commit `8a76a78e41` | commit date 2026-10-16, merge into `feat/musespark-mi355x-sglang-dflash-dayzero`; run->commit API check blocked here (see caveats) |",
    "| Recipe point | `inferencex-e2e/.../musespark/sglang/mi355x-fp4-mtp/agentic.yaml` `override_tp4_c16` | read at `8a76a78e41`: args/env identical to campaign 3's `base_launch_c16.json` (+ runner-owned `--enable-metrics`) -> **verified** |",
    "| Image | `lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:muse-spark-open` @ `sha256:72065dfc0b87818ab415f96c0fc08848233d25f22b002ac8f28c33fad6ec82a4` | perf-changelog entry for the config key at `8a76a78e41` |",
    "| Model | `amd/Muse-Spark-Open-816B-A42B-Quark-MXFP4` @ `c7bc74fd64371315a091bc15f9723882eead0dc1` | campaign 3/5 pins |",
    "| Draft | `RadixArk/Muse-Spark-Open-DFlash2` @ `46c90f412549c472941a68382d91a99e5e6372a0` | campaign 3/5 pins |",
    "| Corpus | `semianalysisai/cc-traces-weka-062126-256k` @ `8fecd2fc56` (recipe default for musespark) | classic copy of the shared hub's |",
    "| Bench client | InferenceX `86699be610` `benchmark_lib.sh` + campaign 5's `bench_agentx.sh` | as campaign 5: `8a76a78e41` no longer ships `benchmark_lib.sh` |",
    "| After inputs | `after/landed.patch` sha256 `a5e33090...`, `after/workspace_config.json` `38aab362...` | copied from b01's session; `INPUTS.sha256` |",
    "",
    "## Decisions",
    "",
    "- **DECISION (QOS):** `amd-agentx-qos` / account `amd-agentx`, 12 h. `amd-hyperloom-qos` is at its 28-node group cap and",
    "  qiangh's 1-job slot there is held by job 295175 (another project, not touched); `amd-primus-qos` has a 0-node group",
    "  limit and no qiangh association. The run needs ~3.5-4 h.",
    "- **Real acceptance**, as campaign 3 served it: the recipe has no synthetic-acceptance flags, although the perf-changelog",
    "  says CI's AL followed the golden curve (4.05). Before and after use the same rule.",
    "- **`GSM8K_MIN` dropped** from the after env: it is the harness's gate variable, not a server setting.",
    "- **One smoke on the before config only** (600 s, GSM8K 200). The after tree is checked by a `git apply --check` dry run",
    "  before any measurement, and by the after run's own gates.",
    "",
    "## Caveats",
    "",
    "- Absolute numbers will not match CI's dashboard or MB's tests: different bench client (InferenceX 86699be610 vs MB's",
    "  `inferencex` 41cc713af8). Before and after share one client, so the ratio is valid.",
    "- b01's Arbor baseline (45784.03, iter 3) already carried the swa-ratio KEEP; the pristine CI point was never measured in",
    "  b01. MB's root measured 46785.1. This run's before is the first independent pristine number on our client.",
    "- Run -> commit mapping of 38877885539 was not cross-checked against the CI API (blocked); commit date and the",
    "  changelog entry agree.",
    "",
    "## Layout",
    "",
    "`experiments/musespark-c16-ab/`: `env.sh`, `hold_node.sbatch`, `dl.sh`, `prepare.sh`, `ab.sh`, `apply_after.sh`,",
    "`run.sh` (pipeline), `compare.py`, `configs/` (before/after + the CI base launch), `after/` (patch + kept config +",
    "lifecycle), `bench/`, `runs/<tag>/`, `logs/`. Node NVMe `/mnt/m2m_nobackup/qiangh_c16ab/hf-hub`. Container `qh_c16ab`,",
    "port 30160, GPUs 0-3.",
    "",
    "## Constraints",
    "",
    "- Never touch other users' containers, processes or jobs. Nothing else runs on GPUs 0-3 during a measurement.",
    "- Do not loosen gates or change CI flags. Any deviation is recorded here and in the worklog.",
    "- Worklog: `reports/2026-11-17_worklog.md` (one entry per step)."
   ]
  }
 ],
