   "head": [
    "# 2026-11-18 summary: campaign 3 (musespark-c16-tput) independent before/after re-measure",
    "",
    "## Blockers and decisions",
    "",
    "- **DECISION (QOS):** job 295364 on `amd-agentx-qos` / account `amd-agentx` (12 h cap). `amd-hyperloom-qos` was at its",
    "  28-node group cap and qiangh's single job slot there was held by another project's job (295175, later 295630,",
    "  grove-solo-compare; not touched). `amd-primus-qos` has a 0-node group limit and no qiangh association. Queue wait",
    "  10 h (2026-11-17 22:52 -> 11-18 08:52).",
    "- **Not verified:** run 38877885539 -> commit `8a76a78e41` (CI API call blocked here); commit date and changelog agree.",
    "  The \"Campaign1 beforeafter4\" reference numbers (11455.49 -> 12179.27) were not found in this project.",
    "- **Caveat:** CI's changelog says AL followed a synthetic golden curve (4.05); the recipe has no synthetic flag. This",
    "  re-measure, like campaign 3, serves real acceptance.",
    "",
    "## Result (code name musespark-c16-ab, node crsuse2-m2m-v3-079, 2026-11-18)",
    "",
    "Model `amd/Muse-Spark-Open-816B-A42B-Quark-MXFP4` @ c7bc74fd64 + DFlash2 @ 46c90f41, SGLang image",
    "`lmsysorg/sglang-rocm:muse-spark-open` @ `72065dfc`, MI355X TP4/EP4, AgentX replay (062126_256k @ 8fecd2fc, InferenceX",
    "86699be610 client) at C16 for 3600 s on a fresh server, then GSM8K 1319 (`sglang.test.few_shot_gsm8k`). Same node, image,",
    "client, corpus and load; only the tree and launch differ.",
    "",
    "| | before (CI point `override_tp4_c16`, pristine) | after (b01 kept tree + kept launch) | change |",
    "|---|---|---|---|",
    "| **Total throughput** | **11733.68 tok/s/GPU** (46934.7 total) | **15302.46 tok/s/GPU** (61209.8 total) | **+30.41 %** |",
    "| Output throughput | 106.31 tok/s/GPU | 136.37 tok/s/GPU | +28.28 % |",
    "| P50 interactivity | 38.96 tok/s/user | 54.89 tok/s/user | +40.89 % |",
    "| P90 interactivity | 17.07 tok/s/user | 27.47 tok/s/user | +60.92 % |",
    "| Requests (measured window) | 1723 | 2274 | +31.98 % |",
    "| KV cache hit rate | 0.920 | 0.950 | +3.0 pts |",
    "| **GSM8K (1319)** | **0.945** | **0.950** | +0.5 pts (within noise) |",
    "",
    "After = image tree + `landed.patch` (5 source KEEPs: iters 4, 6, 17, 24, 35) + launch `--swa-full-tokens-ratio 0.2",
    "--speculative-use-block-verification` (2 config KEEPs: iters 3, 9), verified in the live command line.",
    "",
    "**Iterative vs re-measure (report both):** b01 Arbor 45784.03 -> 63016.66 (+37.6 %; its baseline already carried the",
    "swa-ratio KEEP); MB FINAL 46785.1 -> 63612.8 (+35.97 %); this re-measure +30.41 %. The before matches MB's root within",
    "0.3 %; the after is 3-4 % under the in-run bests (different bench client, single runs). The gain holds; its size is",
    "about 6 points smaller than the in-run figures.",
    "",
    "Files: `experiments/musespark-c16-ab/` (GUIDE.md, runs/{before,after}/bench_output.json, gsm8k.log, server_cmdline.txt,",
    "runs/summary.json). Worklog: reports/2026-11-17_worklog.md."
   ]
  }
 ],
